      <article class="pub reveal">
        <div class="year">2025</div>
        <div>
          <h3><a href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/philosophy-of-science/article/quo-vadis-wheelerdewitt-time-challenging-emergent-time-in-quantum-cosmology/11DE0699A9734786621ADA6AACDB8D9D" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Quo Vadis Wheeler–DeWitt Time? Challenging Emergent Time in Quantum Cosmology</a></h3>
          <p class="meta">with Nicola Bamonti and Enrico Cinti · <span class="venue">Philosophy of Science</span> 92(5), 1327–1337</p>
          <div class="links"><a href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/philosophy-of-science/article/quo-vadis-wheelerdewitt-time-challenging-emergent-time-in-quantum-cosmology/11DE0699A9734786621ADA6AACDB8D9D" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Journal ↗</a></div>
        </div>
